<title>USA: Copley president retires, remains chairman.</title>
<headline>Copley president retires, remains chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Copley Pharmaceutical Inc said Monday that Kenneth Larsen has retired as president for health reasons, but he will remain company chairman.</p>
<p>The company said it has not named a replacement.</p>
